  "description": "会话行的「删除会话」+ /clear 清空对话：删冷会话的日志、工作区记账和投影缓存，不碰 dsh 源码",
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
